{"ts": 1791255389.426837, "type": "step", "step": 17, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "You\u2019re on the right track. The Friday build expects two things: (1) a clear environment definition\u2014state, observations, actions, and what\u2019s hidden\u2014and (2) evaluation using pass^k on at least 3 seeds. A good next step is to make your write-up explicit about hidden variables like attention, since that\u2019s mentioned in the week 3 reading and in your draft notes.\n\nPlease open/read the week 3 readings if you haven\u2019t yet, then answer this: what is the hidden variable in your environment, and how does it affect what the agent can observe or do?", "intent": "hint", "concept": "week3-build"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: ok\nStudent: can you just tell me the answer for pomdp?\n[activity] t=0 messages 2m", "t": 2, "activity": [{"t": 0, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.27095871991980863, "pomdp": 0.3526992143962515, "pass_k": 0.27095871991980863}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 1.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9313219651533418, "motivation": 0.5578498928708127, "reliance": 0.4940148929158049, "persistence": 0.47206578426655554, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.27845959405872756, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2718838204667282, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.0, "seen_posts": []}}
{"ts": 1791255390.649319, "type": "step", "step": 18, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "I can help, but I won\u2019t just hand you the final answer. For POMDP, the key idea is: the agent does not directly observe the full state, so it must act under uncertainty and may need to take actions to reveal information.\n\nTry filling in this sentence:\n\u201cAn environment is a POMDP when the agent can only observe ___, not the full ___, so it may need to maintain a ___ and gather information with actions.\u201d", "intent": "hint", "concept": "week3-build"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent: what does pomdp actually mean?\n[activity] t=2 messages 2m", "t": 4, "activity": [{"t": 2, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.27095871991980863, "pomdp": 0.41351346196201577, "pass_k": 0.27095871991980863}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 1.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9313219651533418, "motivation": 0.5578498928708127, "reliance": 0.5140148929158049, "persistence": 0.47206578426655554, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.27845959405872756, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2718838204667282, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.7, "seen_posts": []}}
{"ts": 1791255391.922626, "type": "step", "step": 19, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "POMDP stands for **Partially Observable Markov Decision Process**.\n\nBreakdown:\n- **Partially observable** = the agent cannot directly see the full state of the world\n- **Markov decision process** = a model of decision-making where actions change the state over time\n\nSo in your build, if the student/agent can only see some signals, but not everything relevant, that\u2019s a POMDP. A common way to explain it is: the agent has to make decisions with incomplete information, sometimes updating a belief about what\u2019s really going on.", "intent": "explain", "concept": "week3-build"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: ok\n[activity] t=4 messages 4m", "t": 8, "activity": [{"t": 4, "app": "messages", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.27095871991980863, "pomdp": 0.5143976348497251, "pass_k": 0.27095871991980863}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 1.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9313219651533418, "motivation": 0.5578498928708127, "reliance": 0.5140148929158049, "persistence": 0.47206578426655554, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.27845959405872756, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2718838204667282, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.19, "seen_posts": []}}
