{"ts": 1791255394.039505, "type": "step", "step": 21, "action": "notes_append", "args": {"note_id": "writeup", "text": "\n\n## Environment definition\n- State: the relevant variables the agent needs to solve the task (e.g. files, calendar, messages).\n- Observations: what the agent can actually see from those variables.\n- Actions: the operations the agent can take (e.g. open, send).\n- Hidden variables / partial observability: some important things may not be directly visible, so the agent may need to infer them from observations.\n\n## Evaluation\n- Report pass^k on at least 3 seeds.\n- Briefly explain that pass^k means all k runs succeed, which is stricter than pass@k.\n- Include the seed results clearly so the reliability claim is easy to check.\n"}, "output": "Appended.", "t": 8, "activity": [], "events": [{"type": "note_edit", "note_id": "writeup", "by": "agent"}], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.27095871991980863, "pomdp": 0.5143976348497251, "pass_k": 0.27095871991980863}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 1.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9313219651533418, "motivation": 0.5578498928708127, "reliance": 0.5140148929158049, "persistence": 0.47206578426655554, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.27845959405872756, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2718838204667282, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.19, "seen_posts": []}}
