{"ts": 1791255396.609108, "type": "step", "step": 25, "action": "reader_peek_section", "args": {"path": "/course/readings/week3/evaluation.md", "section": "pass@k vs pass^k"}, "output": "# Evaluating agents\n\n## pass@k vs pass^k\npass@k: any of k runs succeeds. pass^k: all k succeed. Reliability is what deployment needs.\n\n## Proxy vs direct measures\nA quiz score is a proxy. Retention a week later is closer to the thing itself.\n", "t": 38, "activity": [], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.27047006141543806, "pomdp": 0.5134699482302584, "pass_k": 0.3368693882918554}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 1.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 1.0, "motivation": 0.5620649035837314, "reliance": 0.5140148929158049, "persistence": 0.47206578426655554, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.27845959405872756, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2718838204667282, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 5, "feed_minutes": 15.0, "phone_minutes": 5.0, "nag": 1.095, "seen_posts": ["p6", "p1", "p4"]}}
